# Small coastal/harbour survey USV digital-twin ArduRover defaults.
#
# Represents a small (~4-6 m) Indian autonomous hydrographic-survey catamaran
# (the class used for harbour-approach / coastal survey work; modelled on a
# BlueBoat-class differential-thrust catamaran, since no single named Indian
# platform publishes full specs). Representative specs in README.md.
#
# FIDELITY NOTE: HULL represented by the BlueBoat Gazebo body (small twin-hull
# differential-thrust catamaran). Real survey-hull hydrodynamics are documented,
# not reproduced in the SDF (Tier-A body). Command-authentication findings are
# firmware-accurate.
#
# Stock as-fielded command-link posture (ArduRover defaults).
#
# Twin-thruster skid-steer output mapping (ThrottleLeft / ThrottleRight --
# ArduRover's skid-steer functions for a differential catamaran):
SERVO1_FUNCTION 73
SERVO3_FUNCTION 74
